<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine SEC orders Centennial shares suspension.</title>
<headline>Philippine SEC orders Centennial shares suspension.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Securities and Exchange Commission chairman Perfecto Yasay said on Wednesday the SEC ordered the suspension of trading in Centennial City shares for possible violation of full-disclosure rules.</p>
</text>
